      "notes": "Monroe County is the Rochester metropolitan area (FIPS 36055, pop. 745,000 county-wide). The county-direct FeatureServer at services1.arcgis.com returns 67 confirmed fields on the BASE_MC_Parcels layer, maintained by the Monroe County Planning Department. Key identifiers: COUNTYSBL (full county SBL string, e.g. '141.03-2-47'), PRINTKEY (the formatted print key used on tax maps), and SWIS (the 6-digit State-Wide Information System code that identifies the assessing municipality within Monroe). Owner fields OWNERNAME1/OWNERNAME2 are public. Mailing address is in OWNERSTREETADDRESS, OWNERPOBOX, and OWNERCITYSTATEZIPCODE as a single concatenated field. Building detail fields include BUILDINGSTYLE, EXTERIORWALLMATERIAL, NUMBEROFSTORIES, SQUAREFEETLIVINGAREA, NUMBEROFBEDROOMS, BASEMENTTYPE, CENTRALAIR, and HEATTYPE -- unusually granular for a county REST layer. SEWERTYPE and WATERSUPPLY distinguish municipal vs. private systems. Owner-name queries confirmed live. For current deed and sale records, Monroe County's property lookup is at monroecounty.gov/gis."
